MIT License

This "Sannysoft-style" automation-detection panel (sannysoft.checks.js) is a
self-contained, offline reproduction of well-known open browser-automation checks.
The specific navigator-property / automation-flag checks it performs are derived from
the following upstream projects, each MIT-licensed, gratefully acknowledged:

  - fpscanner / fpcollect — Antoine Vastel
    https://github.com/antoinevastel/fpscanner
    https://github.com/antoinevastel/fp-collect
    Copyright (c) Antoine Vastel

  - intoli-article-materials — Intoli
    https://github.com/intoli/intoli-article-materials
    Copyright (c) 2017 Intoli, LLC

  - detect-headless — Infosimples
    https://github.com/infosimples/detect-headless
    Copyright (c) 2018 Infosimples

